## Ghosting: six points
Ghosting, six points, three minutes. Fast pace, all six positions. Phase two target: every rep at
the beep with a full swish, and form that holds to the last round. Split step on every call, swing
on the beep, and sprint back to the T for the next call.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 3:00
0:00 [go]
0:01 @random{fill, no repeats} [fast all]
18% Rest. Stay engaged. Low and wide at the T.
-0:03 [countdown]
27% @random{fill, no repeats} [fast all]
44% Rest. Feet pointing forward. Knees bent.
-0:03 [countdown]
53% @random{fill, no repeats} [fast all]
71% Rest. Last round. Stay engaged.
-0:03 [countdown]
79% @random{fill, no repeats} [fast all]
